第17题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. （12分）\n（1）"},{"type":"math","value":"E=BL\\cdot\\frac{\\omega L+2\\omega L}{2}=\\frac{3}{2}BL^{2}\\omega=3V"},{"type":"text","value":"----（2分）\n（2）稳定时金属棒所受摩擦力与安培力平衡："},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu mg=IBd"},{"type":"text","value":"----（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"E-Bdv=I(\\frac{r}{3}+R)"},{"type":"text","value":"----（1分）\n解得 v=1m/s ----（1分）\n（3）"},{"type":"math","value":"-\\mu mgt+\\bar{I}Bdt=mv-0"},{"type":"text","value":"----（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"q=\\bar{I}\\cdot t \\Rightarrow q=6C"},{"type":"text","value":"----（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{BdEt}{\\frac{r}{3}+R}-\\frac{B^{2}d^{2}\\bar{v}\\cdot t}{\\frac{r}{3}+R}-\\mu mgt=mv"},{"type":"text","value":"或"},{"type":"math","value":"\\bar{I}\\cdot t=\\frac{E-Bd\\bar{v}}{R+\\frac{r}{3}}\\cdot t"},{"type":"text","value":"----（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"x=\\bar{v}\\cdot t \\Rightarrow x=3m"},{"type":"text","value":"----（1分）\n（4）本小题采用其他方法也可酌情按步骤给分\n设重物匀速上升时金属棒速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则电路中电流："},{"type":"math","value":"I'=\\frac{Bdv_{1}-BL\\frac{3v_{0}+6v_{0}}{2}}{R+\\frac{r}{3}}"},{"type":"text","value":"----（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"B\\mathrm{d}v_{1}\\cdot I'=I'^{2}\\cdot\\left(R+\\frac{r}{3}\\right)+Mgv_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"P _ {F} = B _ {2} \\mathrm{d} v _ {1} \\cdot I _ {2}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Rightarrow P_{F}=11W"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2502-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2502-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"961cac41399fc341d0fbf93e4d7f9d685a418f17c9c5fdae92805df874bdda9d","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（13分）利用磁场和电场实现离子偏转是科学仪器中广泛应用的技术，如图所示，Oxy平面内有一半径为R的圆形磁场，与x轴相切于坐标原点O，圆心 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 在y轴上。在圆形磁场左侧放置一沿y轴方向且长度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" R的放射源ABC，其中A、C是放射源两个端点，B是其中间点，且与 "},{"type":"math","value":"O_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 纵坐标相同，放射源ABC各点沿x轴正方向均匀发射电荷量为q、质量为m，速率均为v的正电荷，单位时间发射的粒子总数为n，这些粒子通过圆形磁场后均由O点飞出。在y=-0.5R处平行x轴放置两块间距极小、厚度忽略不计的足够长的金属网P、Q，在金属网Q下方平行x轴放置足够长的金属收集板M，其中金属网P、收集板M接地，金属网Q的电势为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\varphi"},{"type":"text","value":" ，M、Q之间存在垂直纸面向里的匀强磁场，磁感应强度为B，不计粒子重力，不考虑粒子间相互作用以及粒子对磁场和电势分布的影响。求：\n（1）判断圆形磁场磁感应强度大小及方向；\n（2）从 A 点射出的粒子通过圆形磁场的时间；\n（3）稳态运行时，粒子单位时间到达金属网 Q 的数目 N 与 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\varphi"},{"type":"text","value":" 的关系；\n（4）当金属网 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" 的电势 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\varphi = \\frac{3mv^2}{8q}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，上下平移收集板位置使其恰好能收集到粒子，此时收集板 "},{"type":"math","value":"M"},{"type":"text","value":" 的纵坐标 "},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7c9bcf5450896fcdb453489be7ad7e45ce811a32f4711b60128ae32c17a58142.png","width":1153,"height":961,"width_mm":135.45,"row_group":"gaosan-mingxiao-xiezuoti-2502-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. (13 分)\n(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"Bqv=m\\frac{v^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"B=\\frac{mv}{qR}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分) 方向垂直纸面向外 (1分)\n(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta = 135^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"周期"},{"type":"math","value":"T=\\frac{2\\pi R}{v}"},{"type":"text","value":"或"},{"type":"math","value":"T=\\frac{2\\pi m}{qB}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"t=\\frac{3\\pi R}{4v}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n（3）粒子经过磁场偏转到达 O 点，速度大小为 v，左右与 y 轴成"},{"type":"math","value":"45^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"，\n速度在竖直方向的分量"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac {1}{2} \\sqrt {2} v \\sim v"},{"type":"text","value":"\n则"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}m\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{2}v\\right)^{2} = \\varphi q \\quad \\varphi = \\frac{mv^{2}}{4q}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}mv^{2}=\\varphi q"},{"type":"math","value":"\\varphi=\\frac{mv^{2}}{2q}"},{"type":"text","value":"——（两个公式写出一个可得1分）\n①"},{"type":"math","value":"\\varphi < \\frac{mv^{2}}{4q}"},{"type":"text","value":"N=n \\_\\_\\_\\_（范围考虑才得分）（1分）\n②"},{"type":"math","value":"\\varphi > \\frac{mv^{2}}{2q}"},{"type":"text","value":"N=0 \\_\\_\\_\\_（范围考虑才得分）（1分）\n③"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{mv^{2}}{4q} \\leq \\varphi \\leq \\frac{mv^{2}}{2q}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}m(v\\cos\\theta)^{2} = \\varphi q"},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos\\theta^{2} = \\frac{2\\varphi q}{mv^{2}}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin\\theta = \\sqrt{1 - \\frac{2\\varphi q}{mv^{2}}}"},{"type":"math","value":"N=\\frac{R\\sin\\theta}{\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{2}R}n=\\sqrt{2}n\\sqrt{1-\\frac{2\\varphi q}{mv^{2}}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n（第（3）问中取值范围等号问题不扣分）\n(4) 粒子经过金属网 Q 的速度大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"v'"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}mv'^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}mv^{2}=-\\varphi q\\quad v'=\\frac{1}{2}v"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n通过电场和磁场的作用，粒子轨迹刚好与金属板相切时，刚收集到粒子，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sum Bqv_{y}\\Delta t=mv-(-mv')"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"B q y = \\frac {3}{2} m v"},{"type":"math","value":"y=\\frac{3mv}{2Bq}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"y = -\\left(\\frac{3mv}{2Bq} + 0.5R\\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"}]}}]}
